# Cataractae generated artifacts — deployed to ~/.cistern/cataractae/ at runtime
# PERSONA.md and INSTRUCTIONS.md are source-of-truth and stay tracked.
# These are generated by cataractae_generate and written to ~/.cistern/cataractae/<identity>/
cataractae/**/AGENTS.md
cataractae/**/PIPELINE_POSITION.md
cataractae/**/skills/

